OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists warned of hour-long
OL,4,Adelay after M8 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Ambulance Service said two
OL,7,Fpeople had been treated at the scene
OL,8,Fand discharged. Police Scotland has
OL,9,Fbeen contacted for comment.
